Created `Services/FileSystemWrapper.cs`. It implements `IFileSystem` by delegating all members to an inner instance. All properties are `virtual`, so you can subclass it to override specific behavior, e.g.:

```csharp
public class LoggingFileSystem(IFileSystem inner, ILogger logger)
    : FileSystemWrapper(inner)
{
    public override IFile File => /* wrap with logging */;
}
```

For DI registration, wire it up like:

```csharp
services.AddSingleton<IFileSystem>(new FileSystem());
// or with the wrapper:
services.AddSingleton<IFileSystem>(sp =>
    new FileSystemWrapper(new FileSystem()));
```
